 "final_summary": "The completion_rate was incorrectly rounded to 2 decimal places in tracker/services.py, violating the API contract that requires 4 decimal places. The fix changed the rounding parameter from 2 to 4 in the completion_rate calculation, ensuring compliance with the specification.",
